{"4409610": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Toybox Havoc: Arcade Combat Racing", "steam_appid": 4409610, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4409610/extras/f71f158c33de314328aad3562f927107.poster.avif?t=1782821376\" width=896 height=504 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4409610/extras/f71f158c33de314328aad3562f927107.webm?t=1782821376\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4409610/extras/f71f158c33de314328aad3562f927107.mp4?t=1782821376\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DON'T JUST RACE... DESTROY!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Toybox Havoc combines childhood toy cars with adult competitive rage. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a world where not just the fastest, but the most cunning and aggressive win. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget braking. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Floor it to escape a rocket or wait for the perfect moment to ram your opponent off the track.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4409610/extras/d47c48f000c56512f4f010739b91b43e.poster.avif?t=1782821376\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4409610/extras/d47c48f000c56512f4f010739b91b43e.webm?t=1782821376\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4409610/extras/d47c48f000c56512f4f010739b91b43e.mp4?t=1782821376\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>YOUR PLAYGROUND: YOUR HOME</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No boring asphalt tracks. Every room is now a race track:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Book Tunnels:</strong> Speed through encyclopedias.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kitchen Chaos:</strong> Dodge hot pans and oranges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bedroom:</strong> Jump over messy toys.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every track is full of unique hazards and physics-based obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hit an orange and you're out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4409610/extras/f4301095994f1049622a7b2840df7660.poster.avif?t=1782821376\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4409610/extras/f4301095994f1049622a7b2840df7660.webm?t=1782821376\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4409610/extras/f4301095994f1049622a7b2840df7660.mp4?t=1782821376\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FRIENDSHIP ENDS WHEN THE FIRST ROCKET FIRES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Distance is no barrier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Connect online with friends or survive against ruthless AI.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything is allowed to win:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rockets:</strong> To take down the leader.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shields:</strong> For last-second saves.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mines:</strong> To regret those chasing you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nitro:</strong> For that final straight victory.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online PvP:</strong> Challenge friends or other players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Bots:</strong> No internet? Test skills against advanced AI.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arcade Combat Racing:</strong> Fast, fluid, strategic driving.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics-Based Destruction:</strong> Feel the weight of crashes. Mistakes are not forgiven.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vibrant Graphics:</strong> Stylized, colorful world with a &quot;toy&quot; feel.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full Controller Support:</strong> Sit back and enjoy the chaos.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4409610/extras/f71f158c33de314328aad3562f927107.poster.avif?t=1782821376\" width=896 height=504 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4409610/extras/f71f158c33de314328aad3562f927107.webm?t=1782821376\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4409610/extras/f71f158c33de314328aad3562f927107.mp4?t=1782821376\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DON'T JUST RACE... DESTROY!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Toybox Havoc combines childhood toy cars with adult competitive rage. </p><p class=\